Inclusion Criteria:

1. Patients seeking treatment at the Obesity Unit of the Hospital Medica Sur, Mexico City, Mexico
2. a Body Mass Index higher than 40;
3. written and informed consent to participate.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. other concurrent severe psychiatric disturbances (psychosis, depression with suicidal risk, alcohol or drug abuse);
2. concurrent medical condition not related to the disorder;
3. one or more failures in following an obesity treatment.
